המנדט ה־121 (The 121st Mandate) is a multi-part work — code, content and
third-party data are licensed differently. In short:

  * SOURCE CODE (the app in index.html / biapia/, the build_*.py data
    builders, the Netlify functions, and supporting scripts) is under
    the MIT License below.
  * SITE CONTENT (the site's original texts, design, and original
    data compilations/presentations) is © Harel Cain and licensed
    under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0:
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
    Share and adapt for non-commercial use, with attribution, under
    the same licence.
  * THIRD-PARTY DATA is NOT covered by either licence above and keeps
    its own terms:
      - Knesset data, documents and MK portraits: official
        publications of the Knesset (knesset.gov.il).
      - Hebrew Wikipedia abstracts quoted on MK pages: © Wikipedia
        contributors, CC BY-SA, attributed and linked on each page.
      - Wikidata data (e.g. discovered X handles, labelled as such):
        CC0.

